{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnvectortilesource\/featuresinsourcelayerswithidentifiers:predicate:"]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"featuresInSourceLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"featuresInSourceLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNVectorTileSource(im)featuresInSourceLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"featuresInSourceLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:","kind":"identifier"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSArray","text":"NSArray<id<MLNFeature>>","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"featuresInSourceLayersWithIdentifiers:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSSet","text":"NSSet<NSString *>","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sourceLayerIdentifiers","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"predicate:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSPredicate","text":"NSPredicate","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"predicate","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The source layers to include in the query. Only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the features contained in these source layers are included in the returned"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"array. This array may not be empty."}]}],"name":"sourceLayerIdentifiers"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A predicate to filter the returned features. Use "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"include all loaded features."}]}],"name":"predicate"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An array of objects conforming to the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" protocol that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"represent features loaded by the source that match the predicate."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each object in the returned array represents a feature loaded by the source and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provides access to attributes specified as part of the loaded feature. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"source loads a feature if the source is added to an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"’s style; that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"style has a layer that uses the source; and the map view has recently scrolled"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the region containing the feature."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Features come from tiled vector data that is converted to tiles internally, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"feature geometries are clipped at tile boundaries and features may appear"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"duplicated across tiles. For example, suppose part of a lengthy polyline"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"representing a road has recently scrolled into view. The resulting array"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"includes those parts of the road that lie within the map tiles that the source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has loaded, even if the road extends into other tiles. The portion of the road"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"within each map tile is included individually."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Returned features may not necessarily be visible to the user at the time they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are loaded: the style may contain a layer that forces the source’s tiles to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"load but filters out the features in question, preventing them from being"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drawn. To obtain only "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"visible"}]},{"type":"text","text":" features, use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/visibleFeaturesAtPoint:inStyleLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/visibleFeaturesInRect:inStyleLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"method."}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns an array of map features loaded by this source, restricted to the given"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"source layers and filtered by the given predicate."}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource\/featuresInSourceLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNVectorStyleLayer":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnvectorstylelayer","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNVectorStyleLayer"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" is an abstract superclass for style layers whose content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is defined by an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"MLNVectorStyleLayer"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource","title":"MLNShapeSource","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShapeSource"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","abstract":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference"},{"text":" is a map content source that supplies vector shapes to be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shown on the map. The shapes may be instances of ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or they may be defined by local or external","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"GeoJSON","type":"text"},{"text":" code. A shape source is added to an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference"},{"text":" object along with an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference"},{"text":" object. The vector style","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layer defines the appearance of any content supplied by the shape source. You","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can update a shape source by setting its ","type":"text"},{"code":"shape","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"URL","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"kind":"symbol","title":"MapLibre","role":"collection","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle","title":"MLNStyle","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNStyle"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The proxy object for the current map style."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNVectorTileSource":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnvectortilesource","title":"MLNVectorTileSource","fragments":[{"text":"MLNVectorTileSource","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies tiled vector data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in "},{"type":"text","text":"Mapbox Vector Tile"},{"type":"text","text":" format"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to be shown on the map. The location of and metadata about the tiles are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that conforms to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TileJSON specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A vector tile source is added to an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object along with one or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" objects. A vector style layer defines the appearance of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any content supplied by the vector tile source."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNVectorTileSource/featuresInSourceLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnvectortilesource\/featuresinsourcelayerswithidentifiers:predicate:","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource\/featuresInSourceLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"featuresInSourceLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns an array of map features loaded by this source, restricted to the given"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"source layers and filtered by the given predicate."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"featuresInSourceLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNFeature":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnfeature","title":"MLNFeature","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNFeature"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature"},{"type":"text","text":"  protocol is used to provide details about geographic features"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"contained in an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource"},{"type":"text","text":" object. Each concrete"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"subclass of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"type":"text","text":" in turn has a subclass that conforms to this protocol. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"feature object associates a shape with an optional identifier and attributes."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshape","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShape","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is an abstract class that represents a shape or annotation. Shapes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"constitute the content of a map — not only the overlays atop the map, but also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the content that forms the base map."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MLNShape","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapView/visibleFeaturesInRect:inStyleLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview\/visiblefeaturesinrect:instylelayerswithidentifiers:predicate:","title":"visibleFeaturesInRect:inStyleLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"visibleFeaturesInRect:inStyleLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/visibleFeaturesInRect:inStyleLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns an array of rendered map features that intersect with the given"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rectangle, restricted to the given style layers and filtered by the given"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"predicate."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapView":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview","title":"MLNMapView","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNMapView"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An interactive, customizable map view with an interface similar to the one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provided by Apple’s MapKit."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapView/visibleFeaturesAtPoint:inStyleLayersWithIdentifiers:predic